# Cryptocurrency Analysis- Understanding Trends Risks and Future Implications

**Authors:** Aayush Chaurasia, Somangshu Chakraborty, Aayush Sinha, Yadnesh Govalkar

## Abstract
This research illuminates the dynamic landscape of cryptocurrency markets through a comprehensive
exploration of moving averages and support/resistance levels. Moving averages, both Simple (SMA) and Exponential

(EMA), emerge as sophisticated tools, smoothing market volatility and revealing trends crucial for strategic decision-
making. Meanwhile, the recognition and interpretation of support and resistance levels provide vital reference points,

acting as stabilizing forces in the ever-changing crypto symphony.

